🧠 List vs Tuple
List	                         Tuple
[]	                         ()
Can be changed	                Cannot be changed
Mutable	                        Immutable
Good for changing collections	Good for fixed groups of values
Example: ["Apple", "Bread"]	Example: ("Apple", 50, 3)

In this project:

Cart → List
Item → Tuple

Why?

The cart needs to change because I can:

Add items
Remove items
Update quantities

But one item can be grouped as:

("Apple", 50, 3)


