⚠️ Small Implementation Note

When adding an existing item, the code correctly rebuilds the tuple because tuples cannot be modified directly.

However, the current code doesn't validate negative or zero values for price and quantity. For example, it would accept an unusual quantity such as -2.

That isn't part of the required functionality, so the current project still fulfills the main task.



